WEBVTT

00:28.750 --> 00:32.290
Enemies though we are,
I must commend your combat prowess.

00:32.290 --> 00:34.710
But surely you've realized by now...

00:34.710 --> 00:37.170
You are no match for my power.

00:37.170 --> 00:40.630
The Human Realm shall be overrun
by my loyal minions!

00:40.830 --> 00:43.710
Dammit... It's the end of the line...

00:43.920 --> 00:45.580
Don't give up, Fred!

01:10.880 --> 01:14.330
Then I shall be the bringer of your demise...

01:19.630 --> 01:21.040
Protection!

01:26.080 --> 01:28.130
How laughable!

01:28.130 --> 01:29.670
You're a fool!

01:32.880 --> 01:34.880
Leo! Hang in there!

01:37.920 --> 01:38.750
Yuria!

01:38.750 --> 01:40.380
Strike Edge!

01:46.580 --> 01:48.170
GO!

02:09.040 --> 02:11.750
Max the Hero...

02:13.670 --> 02:17.540
You have masterfully defeated me,
the almighty Demon Lord...

02:17.540 --> 02:23.130
However, my loyal minions
shall live on for an eternity...

02:23.540 --> 02:25.540
Mark my words, I shall return!

02:25.540 --> 02:29.420
And when I do, you shall suffer
my blood-soaked vengeance!

02:29.420 --> 02:31.170
Until we meet again...

02:37.710 --> 02:38.830
Ah, at last!

02:38.830 --> 02:40.290
The time has finally come!

02:40.290 --> 02:42.420
I am reborn!

02:42.420 --> 02:45.750
You had best prepare yourself, Max the Hero!

02:49.540 --> 02:52.880
My warmest congratulations to you
on your rebirth, Your Grace.

02:53.130 --> 02:55.420
Yes. It's been a while, Zenia.

02:55.420 --> 02:57.380
Are you the only one awake right now?

02:57.380 --> 02:59.130
Where's everyone else?

02:59.130 --> 03:03.460
They have remained in a state of slumber
since the battle with the Hero ten years ago.

03:03.710 --> 03:07.130
Unbelievable... Useless bastards,
every last one of them...

03:07.130 --> 03:09.330
By the way, did you get taller?

03:09.330 --> 03:12.830
Your Grace... For now, let's focus on
finding you some clothes.

03:14.830 --> 03:19.380
Zenia... I thought I told you to fetch
my favorite dress robes...

03:19.580 --> 03:23.630
Those are the genuine article, milord.
This was your preferred attire ten years ago.

03:24.000 --> 03:26.880
As you can see,
Your Grace's physique has changed.

03:26.880 --> 03:30.630
It would seem that your powers did not
reaccumulate in a mere ten years,

03:30.630 --> 03:32.960
resulting in an underdeveloped physical form.

03:32.960 --> 03:34.080
Your p-

03:34.080 --> 03:35.920
This includes your nether regions, as well.

03:36.920 --> 03:38.960
All my muscles are gone...

03:38.960 --> 03:40.920
But fret not, milord.

03:41.290 --> 03:44.290
I, Zenia, your faithful secretary,
predicted this might happen,

03:44.290 --> 03:48.790
so I've taken the liberty of preparing
a few outfits that will suit your new body.

03:50.000 --> 03:51.170
Zenia...

03:51.380 --> 03:53.040
What the devil are these clothes?

03:53.040 --> 03:56.210
This is the traditional attire for
a mage in the Human Realm.

03:56.210 --> 03:57.630
It looks handsome on you.

03:57.630 --> 04:01.250
I don't remember any of the Hero's companions
wearing something so... frilly.

04:01.460 --> 04:05.330
This is what's known as a "uniform."
It is the professional attire for maidservants.

04:05.330 --> 04:08.210
And why should I wear
the clothing of a lowly maid?!

04:08.580 --> 04:12.880
This attire has been consistently used for
many years by those pursuing an education.

04:12.880 --> 04:14.210
"Talk to the hand!"

04:14.210 --> 04:17.170
Milord, that phrase was already
out of style ten years ago.

04:17.170 --> 04:21.580
<b>Loyalty</b>

04:17.460 --> 04:20.330
Now, in the event that you choose
to partake in aquatic activities-

04:20.250 --> 04:21.580
<b>Demon</b>

04:20.330 --> 04:21.580
No! That is enough!

04:21.880 --> 04:25.500
Unbelievable... Presenting me with
all these useless outfits...

04:25.500 --> 04:27.080
Apologies, Your Grace.

04:27.290 --> 04:29.250
Well, I suppose I should've
expected as much

04:29.250 --> 04:31.750
given your outlandish and
disgraceful appearance...

04:31.750 --> 04:33.080
Excuse me, asshole?

04:33.460 --> 04:34.790
By the way, Zenia...

04:34.790 --> 04:36.670
What's he up to nowadays?

04:36.670 --> 04:39.000
"He," Your Grace?

04:39.000 --> 04:42.880
Who the hell else would I be talking about?!
That accursed Max the Hero, of course!

04:42.880 --> 04:44.330
Well...

04:44.330 --> 04:47.040
After all, this is the man
who managed to defeat ME.

04:47.040 --> 04:50.750
I have no doubt he's made a name for
himself over these last ten years!

04:50.750 --> 04:54.210
In fact, I wouldn't be surprised
if he's been dubbed royalty!

04:54.500 --> 04:56.250
Speak up, Zenia! What's become of him?

04:56.250 --> 04:59.130
Uh... Yes, about that...

04:59.130 --> 05:00.380
The truth is...

05:00.380 --> 05:04.420
Regarding the Hero's current status,
it's still largely a mystery...

05:04.420 --> 05:05.500
What?

05:05.500 --> 05:08.290
As far as the social and
political stages go, at least,

05:08.290 --> 05:10.210
it would seem that he has disappeared.

05:10.210 --> 05:12.710
But why? I don't understand...

05:13.960 --> 05:15.710
Oh, yes! That must be it!

05:15.960 --> 05:19.420
He has removed himself from this earthly
existence as part of his spiritual training!

05:19.420 --> 05:22.130
He saved all of humanity and yet
maintained his humble attitude!

05:22.130 --> 05:24.420
Talk about a TRUE hero!

05:25.500 --> 05:28.790
I'm getting more excited for
our reunion by the second!

05:29.250 --> 05:30.290
Ahem.

05:30.630 --> 05:32.000
Come along, milord.

05:32.000 --> 05:35.080
Your official duties have piled up
sky high in your absence.

05:35.080 --> 05:37.380
Please forget about the Hero for now.

05:37.380 --> 05:38.250
Huh?

05:38.250 --> 05:40.080
Not a chance, dear Zenia!

05:40.080 --> 05:43.540
The Hero is the greatest threat to
myself and my loyal minions.

05:43.540 --> 05:45.420
I cannot simply look the other way.

05:45.420 --> 05:47.210
With all due respect, Your Grace...

05:47.210 --> 05:51.210
He may possess superhuman strength,
but at the end of the day, he is only human.

05:51.210 --> 05:54.000
He's destined to grow old
and die before long.

05:54.000 --> 05:57.830
You no longer need concern yourself with
an insignificant mortal such as he.

06:01.290 --> 06:03.540
You're hiding something from me, aren't you?

06:04.580 --> 06:08.460
Is there something about the Hero
you wish for me not to know?

06:08.460 --> 06:12.170
P-p-preposterous! H-h-hide?!
F-f-from you, milord?!

06:13.290 --> 06:14.540
It can't be...!

06:14.540 --> 06:17.630
Tell me he's not already dead!
Tell me, Zenia!

06:17.630 --> 06:19.790
Was it disease?!
Or was it an assassination?!

06:19.790 --> 06:21.750
Please! Tell me you're lying!

06:21.750 --> 06:23.330
Y-Your Grace! C..calm-

06:23.790 --> 06:25.210
I must see it for myself!

06:25.210 --> 06:26.630
Third eye, activate!

06:27.920 --> 06:28.960
What's this...?!

06:28.960 --> 06:32.130
I'd know that life force anywhere!
It's that pesky Hero!

06:32.540 --> 06:34.580
Oh, I guess he's still alive!

06:34.580 --> 06:36.790
You had me worried for a minute there!

06:37.080 --> 06:40.830
<b>Wagnark Union</b>

06:37.080 --> 06:40.830
<b>Trachigo</b>

06:37.080 --> 06:40.830
<b>Gamma Republic</b>

06:37.090 --> 06:40.830
<b>Beskar Kingdom</b>

06:37.090 --> 06:40.830
<b>Lavikia</b>

06:37.090 --> 06:40.830
<b>Sergendine</b>

06:37.090 --> 06:40.830
<b>Tauxanth</b>

06:37.090 --> 06:40.830
<b>Dark Lands</b>

06:37.090 --> 06:40.830
<b>Demon Castle</b>

06:37.460 --> 06:40.830
It appears he's located somewhere near
the humans' imperial capital...

06:41.130 --> 06:42.750
Yes, I see...

06:42.750 --> 06:43.790
Very well!

06:43.790 --> 06:45.460
Then I shall go and take a quick peek!

06:45.460 --> 06:46.290
WHAT?!

06:46.290 --> 06:48.790
Wh-where are you going?!
You mustn't do this, milord!

06:49.000 --> 06:51.790
I'm just going to pop by and say hello!

06:51.790 --> 06:54.750
I'll be back in no time, so be sure
and have my supper ready.

06:54.750 --> 06:57.670
Please wait, Your Grace!
The present Hero is-

06:58.460 --> 07:00.290
Indeed! I have no doubt the present Hero

07:00.290 --> 07:03.670
is in the midst of celebrating
this temporary moment of peace.

07:03.670 --> 07:05.580
Which is why I must announce my return...

07:05.580 --> 07:08.580
and strike both fear and despair
into his heart once more!

07:08.580 --> 07:10.920
Don't do this, milord!
You're going to regret it!

07:10.920 --> 07:12.540
Enough! No more of your nonsense!

07:13.460 --> 07:15.830
This is why I awoke from my slumber early!

07:15.830 --> 07:17.960
I shall NOT be dissuaded!

07:18.630 --> 07:21.000
Come back, Your Grace!

07:22.540 --> 07:24.710
The look of pure joy on his face...

07:25.290 --> 07:29.420
Please forgive me, milord,
for not being able to stop you...!

07:39.880 --> 07:42.000
I haven't visited the
Human Realm in a while...

07:43.130 --> 07:46.500
There it is!
Those heathens' crudely constructed city...

07:46.500 --> 07:48.500
Though it does seem
their civilization has progressed

07:48.500 --> 07:50.130
since I last saw it all those years ago...

07:54.670 --> 07:56.330
I'm getting close now!

07:56.330 --> 08:00.290
I can only imagine the Hero's face
when he realizes that I've made my return...

08:00.290 --> 08:02.080
The anticipation is killing me!

08:03.630 --> 08:05.040
<b>One-Room Video</b>

08:05.210 --> 08:06.670
It's that building down there!

08:06.670 --> 08:08.250
Here I go!

08:11.710 --> 08:13.920
It's been a long time, Max the Hero!

08:13.920 --> 08:17.500
Behold: I have fulfilled my promise
and been reborn at last!

08:17.500 --> 08:20.040
What's the matter?!
Have I shocked you speechless?!

08:24.670 --> 08:25.750
Huh...?

08:29.500 --> 08:30.500
Huh?

08:29.500 --> 08:31.920
<b>Level 1 Demon Lord</b>

08:29.500 --> 08:31.920
<b>and One Room Hero</b>

08:37.540 --> 08:38.630
<b>Level 1 Demon Lord and One Room Hero</b>

10:02.420 --> 10:07.210
<b>#1 The Demon Lord Returns!</b>

10:07.540 --> 10:09.330
Who the hell are you?

10:11.580 --> 10:14.670
Ah, my apologies.
I must've made a mistake.

10:14.670 --> 10:16.670
I mean, my name is Max...

10:17.170 --> 10:19.130
Oh please, surely you jest...

10:19.130 --> 10:21.210
Three eyes and a pair of horns...

10:21.210 --> 10:23.040
You a demon?

10:23.040 --> 10:25.790
The hell would a demon want with me now?

10:26.580 --> 10:29.210
That's Blazebringer, the Holy Blade!

10:29.210 --> 10:30.420
I'd know it anywhere...

10:30.420 --> 10:33.540
The sword that sliced
my right arm to ribbons!

10:33.540 --> 10:36.130
Wait a minute, are you...?

10:36.130 --> 10:38.330
Oh yeah, he mentioned
bein' resurrected or someth-

10:38.330 --> 10:41.290
Don't just toss the Holy Blade aside
like it's yesterday's trash!

10:41.290 --> 10:43.000
Now sit up, you bum!

10:45.420 --> 10:50.630
Are you absolutely positive that you're
the Max who defeated me ten years ago...?

10:50.630 --> 10:52.210
That's what I been tellin' ya.

10:52.210 --> 10:53.580
Ugh, my back...

10:53.580 --> 10:55.790
But you're flabby! Physically AND mentally!

10:55.790 --> 10:58.040
I mean, what happened to
that chiseled jawline of yours?!

10:58.040 --> 11:01.290
Shaddup! People age.
It's completely natural, y'know.

11:01.290 --> 11:04.290
You're a far cry from ten years ago!
I didn't even recognize you!

11:04.290 --> 11:06.130
Yeah, well, you're one to talk!

11:06.130 --> 11:07.710
Why're you wearing a sailor uniform?

11:09.920 --> 11:12.420
And just look at this squalid dump of yours...

11:12.750 --> 11:15.960
I can't place that foul stench... Is it BO?

11:15.960 --> 11:18.330
Knock it off!
Don't sniff your finger like that!

11:18.330 --> 11:20.210
Are these old food containers?

11:20.210 --> 11:22.460
Throw 'em out or you'll get ants...

11:22.460 --> 11:25.630
Used tissues, too? Unbelievable...
I'll just put these in the trash...

11:25.630 --> 11:29.000
You're brave, pickin' up tissues
off the floor of someone's house...

11:29.790 --> 11:32.460
What's this thing? It's got a hole in it...

11:32.460 --> 11:33.880
And it's squishy...

11:33.880 --> 11:36.420
CUT IT OUT!
DON'T MESS AROUND WITH THAT!

11:38.540 --> 11:41.330
This must be one of those
digital devices you humans use!

11:41.330 --> 11:43.460
I told you to quit poking around in my stuff!

11:43.460 --> 11:46.670
Hmm... Input text with this keyboard, and...

11:46.670 --> 11:50.080
Oh, I see! It's a tool used for
research purposes, isn't it?

11:50.080 --> 11:52.130
You humans are clever sometimes!

11:52.130 --> 11:53.790
Why did you come here...?

11:53.790 --> 11:55.130
I almost forgot!

11:59.710 --> 12:01.080
Max the Hero!

12:01.080 --> 12:03.580
It would appear you've gotten
complacent over the last ten years,

12:03.580 --> 12:05.290
taking this era of peace for granted!

12:05.290 --> 12:06.080
Yeah?

12:06.080 --> 12:09.330
Bear witness, for I have returned
stronger than ever!

12:09.330 --> 12:13.710
And this time, you puny, pathetic humans
shall bow down to my authority!

12:18.250 --> 12:20.830
Aren'tcha... gonna say anything?

12:20.830 --> 12:24.750
Your old archnemesis is back...
Not even a "Not on my watch!"?

12:24.750 --> 12:26.420
Nah, I'm good.

12:26.420 --> 12:28.000
Are you kidding me?!

12:28.000 --> 12:31.130
That was the whole reason I awoke
from my slumber early!

12:31.130 --> 12:33.170
So I could make you suffer
before you shriveled up and died!

12:33.170 --> 12:34.880
Tell it to someone who cares!

12:34.880 --> 12:38.330
I remember you being full of passion,
courage, and conviction ten years ago!

12:38.330 --> 12:41.080
What in the hell changed since then?!

12:41.080 --> 12:43.500
Ya wanna know what changed?

12:44.080 --> 12:45.750
That's an easy one.

12:45.750 --> 12:48.170
After I defeated you and
evicted your demon buddies,

12:48.170 --> 12:50.290
the world didn't need me anymore.

12:50.290 --> 12:52.380
No medal, no reward, nothin'.

12:52.380 --> 12:55.250
I faded into obscurity,
and now I'm a nobody.

12:55.250 --> 12:57.080
That can't be... This isn't right!

12:57.080 --> 12:58.460
Damn those humans!

12:58.460 --> 13:01.000
How can they have so little
respect for the Hero

13:01.000 --> 13:03.080
who saved everything
they've ever known and loved?!

13:03.580 --> 13:07.960
Heroes are as useless to a world at peace
as a screen door is on a submarine...

13:07.960 --> 13:10.250
If anything, they're seen as a nuisance.

13:11.630 --> 13:13.630
Livin' like a bum is easier...

13:13.880 --> 13:17.830
Okay, uh... "M-a-x t-h-e H-e-r-o"... Enter!

13:18.170 --> 13:21.080
Oh, we got lots of hits! Let's see here...

13:21.080 --> 13:22.130
Hey, don't do that!

13:22.130 --> 13:24.290
<b>Max the Hero</b>

13:22.130 --> 13:24.290
<b>Max the Hero has a Scandelous Affair?!</b>

13:22.130 --> 13:24.290
<b>Charges Filed against Max the Hero for Violent Attack on Citizen</b>

13:22.130 --> 13:24.290
<b>Max the Hero's Secret Love Child Comes to Light!!</b>

13:24.630 --> 13:25.920
"Alleged affair"...?

13:25.920 --> 13:27.960
No, no, no! I didn't do it, I swear!

13:28.170 --> 13:30.500
The article links to a video of
a press conference.

13:30.500 --> 13:32.710
Do you make all of your decisions
with your downstairs brain?

13:32.710 --> 13:34.000
That's a waterfall of sweat...

13:34.000 --> 13:35.250
You did it, didn't you?

13:35.250 --> 13:36.830
I'm innocent! Just let me explain!

13:36.830 --> 13:38.920
I had no idea she was a married woman!

13:38.920 --> 13:40.040
I was framed!

13:40.040 --> 13:42.170
It was one of those
money-hungry hero hunters!

13:42.170 --> 13:44.170
The husband HAD to be in on it!

13:44.500 --> 13:45.540
Huh...

13:45.540 --> 13:47.880
Well, you reap what you sow.

13:47.880 --> 13:51.670
That's what happens when you go around
flirting with women just for the heck of it.

13:52.420 --> 13:54.080
On to the next article...

13:54.380 --> 13:57.290
What in the devil?!
"Violent attack on a citizen"?!

13:57.500 --> 13:58.920
Dude, are you serious...?

13:58.920 --> 14:00.080
H-hold on!

14:00.080 --> 14:03.630
That headline is misleading and one-sided
and meant to make me look bad!

14:03.630 --> 14:05.920
There were six of those bastards!

14:05.920 --> 14:08.040
They snuck up on me and started swingin'!

14:08.040 --> 14:10.420
Can you really blame me
for defending myself?!

14:10.420 --> 14:12.880
You could've just as easily ran away.

14:13.500 --> 14:17.790
I mean, you managed to escape the clutches of
my undead army ten years ago, didn't you?

14:17.790 --> 14:21.290
Well... It's not like either side
made it out unscathed...

14:21.500 --> 14:24.960
Let me guess: You drank too much alcohol
and lost your temper?

14:24.960 --> 14:26.750
Pathetic, I swear...

14:27.500 --> 14:29.580
You know what? This is kinda fun!

14:29.580 --> 14:31.080
Let's see, next article...

14:31.080 --> 14:33.170
Haven't you tortured me enough?!
Just drop it!

14:34.830 --> 14:36.380
WHAT?!

14:35.250 --> 14:36.670
<b>Max the Hero</b>

14:35.250 --> 14:36.670
<b>Cheating on 10 Different Women?!</b>

14:36.790 --> 14:38.920
SON OF A BITCH!
HOW COULD YOU STOOP SO LOW?!

14:38.920 --> 14:41.630
I didn't! Every last one of those
accusations were unfounded!

14:41.630 --> 14:44.080
I don't remember raising you to be
a piece of garbage, Max!

14:44.080 --> 14:45.920
Are you insane?! Get a grip!

14:47.330 --> 14:51.380
I'd never even seen those ten women before,
so I denied it over and over, but...

14:51.380 --> 14:53.330
"An after-hours holy sword rampage!"

14:53.330 --> 14:56.130
"The tip of his Blazebringer penetrates
more than just armor!"

14:56.130 --> 14:57.920
The jokes wrote themselves!

14:57.920 --> 14:59.670
"H-his Blazebringer"...?

15:00.210 --> 15:02.460
Okay, that's... a pretty good one...

15:03.250 --> 15:05.080
SHUT YOUR DAMN MOUTH!

15:05.250 --> 15:07.040
Come on, don't let it get you down!

15:07.040 --> 15:09.460
Here, I'll pull up some of your
more flattering moments.

15:10.630 --> 15:13.460
Yes, it's true. I defeated the Demon Lord.

15:13.670 --> 15:16.750
But I certainly didn't achieve
such a feat on my own.

15:16.750 --> 15:19.130
I had my dearest friends beside me,

15:19.130 --> 15:23.000
as well as an outpouring of support
from people all around the world.

15:23.000 --> 15:25.290
That's how I, as a human being,

15:25.290 --> 15:27.710
was able to stand against the Demon Lord
with my head held high.

15:28.750 --> 15:32.330
To me, the Demon Lord's destruction
is a milestone of sorts.

15:32.670 --> 15:34.540
I believe that my next mission
is to continue searching

15:34.540 --> 15:37.210
for an answer to a very important question.

15:37.540 --> 15:39.540
We've ushered in an era of
precious, precious peace.

15:39.540 --> 15:42.580
Now what can I, as a hero, do to protect it?

15:43.880 --> 15:45.250
<b>The End</b>

15:47.000 --> 15:49.380
That was so cheesy!
You sound like a total jackass!

15:49.380 --> 15:51.500
O-oh my god, my stomach!
Being a hero means living in<b>
</b>the hearts and minds of millions-<b></b>

15:51.500 --> 15:53.460
STOP! TURN IT OFF!
Being a hero means living in<b>
</b>the hearts and minds of millions-<b></b>

15:53.790 --> 15:56.710
Well, when you act that insufferable,

15:56.710 --> 15:58.920
it's not hard to imagine why people
want to expose you.

15:58.920 --> 16:00.920
"The nail that sticks out gets hammered down."

16:00.920 --> 16:03.210
Tell that to the Max from ten years ago...

16:03.210 --> 16:05.750
I guess that explains how you ended up here...

16:09.080 --> 16:11.130
Is this a photo of your companions?

16:11.460 --> 16:14.330
It seems you treat them better
than you treat your sword.

16:14.330 --> 16:16.580
It's really not that big a deal...

16:17.000 --> 16:19.500
Ah, look at that toned physique...

16:19.500 --> 16:22.250
And a gaze that just screams
"hidden potential"...

16:22.250 --> 16:25.420
Where the hell did THIS Max go...?

16:25.420 --> 16:28.630
Okay, the obsession with me
is gettin' a little freaky...

16:28.630 --> 16:31.080
Are you and your companions still close?

16:31.080 --> 16:33.170
Haven't seen 'em in years.

16:33.170 --> 16:34.960
That's pretty sad...

16:35.630 --> 16:37.880
That's just how life goes.

16:37.880 --> 16:41.500
Relationships don't last when there's
nothin' in it for the people involved.

16:41.500 --> 16:44.960
Why would I bother seein' those guys
after all this time?

16:44.960 --> 16:46.920
You've got it backwards...

16:47.250 --> 16:49.830
It's that egotistical attitude of yours

16:49.830 --> 16:52.210
that drove a wedge between you
and your companions.

16:52.210 --> 16:53.790
Quit your yappin' already!

16:53.790 --> 16:55.790
And don't act like you know me...

16:55.790 --> 16:57.500
Get out. I'm tired of you.

16:59.170 --> 17:02.250
Now I get why Zenia tried to stop me
from coming here...

17:02.750 --> 17:04.960
The Hero I knew is long gone...

17:05.420 --> 17:08.170
I'm leaving. We shall never meet again.

17:08.170 --> 17:10.420
Good, get lost!

17:11.000 --> 17:12.670
Y'see, but the thing is...

17:12.670 --> 17:16.080
The Human Realm cannot prevail
without its precious Hero around!

17:16.380 --> 17:19.830
I shall return home, rouse everyone from
their slumber, and reassemble my army!

17:19.830 --> 17:22.250
You foolish humans won't even know
what hit you!

17:22.250 --> 17:25.580
'Kay, sounds good! Go ahead and
destroy this crappy world!

17:25.920 --> 17:28.670
Things could get rather hairy
for your companions!

17:28.670 --> 17:31.290
Perhaps I should pay them a visit
right now and slice their heads off!

17:31.290 --> 17:32.670
Oh, good idea!

17:32.670 --> 17:35.500
'Specially since I owe Leo
a nice chunk of change.

17:35.500 --> 17:38.000
If he's dead, I won't have to worry
about payin' him back!

17:39.130 --> 17:40.540
DAMN YOU!

17:40.750 --> 17:44.670
YOU DESERVE... TO ROT IN HELL!

17:49.500 --> 17:52.080
Haven't lost your touch, I see...

17:57.380 --> 17:58.540
What bullshit...

17:58.540 --> 18:01.790
They're not stupid enough to get killed
by a pipsqueak like you...

18:08.330 --> 18:12.380
Huh...? Wh-what happened...?

18:12.580 --> 18:14.880
I'm in a... closet?

18:14.880 --> 18:18.000
That infuriating Hero...
Why wouldn't he just finish me off...?

18:32.540 --> 18:33.630
That's it...!

18:33.920 --> 18:34.920
Seriously?

18:36.040 --> 18:39.080
Can't you at least wait until I'm gone
to do that kind of stuff...?

18:39.080 --> 18:40.790
What is WRONG with you?!
Stay in the closet!

18:44.250 --> 18:46.880
Why didn't you slaughter me
when you had the chance?

18:46.880 --> 18:49.040
You could have done it if you wanted to...

18:49.040 --> 18:51.210
I ain't a hero anymore.

18:51.210 --> 18:53.380
Got no business killin' demon lords.

18:53.380 --> 18:55.710
In fact, if I were to kill you
in your current state,

18:55.710 --> 18:57.750
tomorrow's headlines would probably read,

18:57.750 --> 19:00.080
"Hero's Abuse Results in
Death of Secret Love Child."

19:00.080 --> 19:02.670
Yeah, that would be a problem...

19:03.040 --> 19:04.630
Here, coffee.

19:07.580 --> 19:08.750
Ew, yuck!

19:08.750 --> 19:10.750
Got any orange juice instead?

19:10.750 --> 19:12.630
God, you're a pain in the ass...

19:15.460 --> 19:18.380
Well, there's no denying you're Max the Hero.

19:18.380 --> 19:20.080
Now what?

19:20.080 --> 19:23.080
Your lightning-fast movements,
your masterful technique...

19:23.080 --> 19:25.040
And you're still every bit as strong.

19:25.040 --> 19:27.540
Yes, I could sense it...

19:27.540 --> 19:29.830
The fiery spirit of a hero burning
deep within your chest...

19:29.830 --> 19:31.920
That's what we call "talk shit, get hit."

19:31.920 --> 19:33.790
And by the way,
you're the one who's gone soft.

19:35.290 --> 19:39.000
A pipsqueak like you,
slicing my crew's heads off? Hilarious.

19:39.000 --> 19:42.210
Sh-shut up! I'm not myself
'cause I just woke up, that's all!

19:42.540 --> 19:45.170
Mark my words! My current dilemma
may be unfortunate...

19:45.170 --> 19:49.420
...but someday, I shall restore my full strength
and force the Human Realm into submission!

19:49.420 --> 19:52.210
And when that happens,
we shall do battle once again!

19:54.040 --> 19:56.710
Sorry, but I can't promise that.

19:58.420 --> 20:02.630
It's just like you said: I made my bed,
and now I gotta lie in it.

20:02.630 --> 20:03.460
Still...

20:04.210 --> 20:07.710
I'd be lying if I said I wasn't
utterly disgusted with the world.

20:07.710 --> 20:10.880
It destroyed any ambition
to be a hero I ever had.

20:10.880 --> 20:14.420
Besides, I wasn't the first hero,
and I probably won't be the last.

20:14.420 --> 20:16.710
Eventually, whenever you start causing trouble,

20:16.710 --> 20:19.630
a brand new hero will rise to the occasion.

20:22.790 --> 20:24.880
I... see.

20:25.540 --> 20:26.920
Alright then...

20:30.250 --> 20:33.250
Sorry for barging in.
I appreciate your hospitality.

20:36.380 --> 20:37.630
Farewell.

20:37.630 --> 20:40.330
Yup, it was nice catchin' up with ya.

20:40.330 --> 20:41.420
Later.

20:55.790 --> 20:57.460
Maybe I'll take a bath...

20:57.460 --> 20:58.630
I'm back!

20:59.540 --> 21:01.460
Can I borrow the kitchen?

21:02.420 --> 21:04.830
It's a good thing I thought to bring
some human money.

21:05.630 --> 21:08.630
The cashier called me a "good little helper"
for running errands.

21:08.630 --> 21:10.710
You don't get enough vitamins, do you?

21:11.080 --> 21:13.290
I'll throw together a hot pot for us!

21:13.830 --> 21:15.420
What...? Wait...

21:15.420 --> 21:17.330
What the hell are you doing?

21:17.630 --> 21:20.750
You are vastly more terrifying now
than you were ten years ago!

21:20.750 --> 21:23.330
Well, after I left, I did some thinking...

21:23.330 --> 21:27.420
The thought of turning a blind eye to a man
of your caliber was just far too tragic.

21:27.420 --> 21:32.130
Besides, a lot has changed in human society,
so I figured I ought to study up on it!

21:32.460 --> 21:35.500
Which is why I'm going to be staying
at your place for a while.

21:35.500 --> 21:36.420
WHAT?!

21:36.420 --> 21:38.040
LIKE HELL AM I GONNA BABYSIT YOUR ASS!

21:38.040 --> 21:41.000
Babysit me?! Don't get it twisted!

21:41.290 --> 21:44.460
I'm saying that I'M going to be the one
looking after YOU!

21:44.460 --> 21:45.500
You should be grateful!

21:49.630 --> 21:51.790
Whaddya think? Tasty, right?

21:51.790 --> 21:54.500
I gotta admit, it's surprisingly decent...

21:54.750 --> 21:57.960
That's 'cause I've mastered
the five fundamental seasonings!

21:57.960 --> 21:59.580
Before I aim for the Human Realm,

21:59.580 --> 22:02.670
I need to have a good grasp
on your stomach first!

22:03.000 --> 22:06.130
I'll be making your meals every day
from now on, so get ready!

22:06.130 --> 22:07.630
Smells delicious...

22:08.580 --> 22:10.250
Did you say something just now?

22:10.250 --> 22:12.080
Huh? Uh, no...?

22:12.080 --> 22:14.540
Oh. Well, eat up!
